      "text": "READING KEY: arrows inside attention heads are data flow; orange bypasses carry residual inputs.\nBottom-left panel is a reference checklist, NOT a sequential computational pipeline. Batch dimension B is retained.\nOne representative design, not every Transformer variant. Sinusoidal positions + ReLU + post-norm follow the original family.",
